  <div class="prose">
    <p>Global averages mask dramatic regional disparities. The Americas consistently record the highest homicide rates of any region, while parts of Asia, Europe, and Oceania maintain rates well below the global median. This section disaggregates the data by region and highlights the countries at both extremes.</p>
