  <div class="prose">
    <p>Intentional homicide is profoundly gendered. Across virtually all countries and time periods in this dataset, males are disproportionately represented among victims. The male-to-female homicide rate ratio — a critical indicator of gendered violence patterns — reveals both the scale of this disparity and how it varies across geographies.</p>
