<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     SECTION 6: DATA LIMITATIONS & RECOMMENDATIONS
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="section" id="s6">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-number">6</div>
    <div class="section-title">Data Limitations &amp; Policy Recommendations</div>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>Rigorous policy analysis requires transparency about data quality. This dataset — while the most comprehensive global source on intentional homicide — has significant structural limitations that directly affect how findings should be interpreted and applied.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title">Data Completeness & Coverage</div>
    <div class="chart-container">
      <canvas id="sexCoverageChart"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>

